  m_Name: Story_walt
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: walt
  title: Delgado & Petrakis
  summary: 'Walt is proud, grumpy and his knee is failing. He and Gus were partners until Gus built the first tower for Sterling. Fork: get the two of them to build the plaza bandstand together, or help Walt finish his secret project alone.'
  pathAName: Build it with Gus
  pathBName: Finish it alone
  parts:
