  - title: Something in the shed
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I'm building something. In the shed. Don't ask what.
    - I need good wood, and Frank's timber is too wet, whatever he says. You've got trees out there. Fifteen pieces. Straight ones, mind.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74774f685447bd4458cd1bed839c572e, type: 2}
      amount: 15
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Wood for Walt's shed
      questText: Walt wants 15 pieces of good Wood for something he's building in his shed. He won't say what.
      reminder:
      - The wood? Fifteen. Straight. If it's bent, take it to Frank, he'll sell it to somebody.
      thanks:
      - Hm. Not bad. Not bad at all.
      - Here. Fair price. Now don't go telling Rosa there's anything in the shed.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 180
