      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: The last ladder
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Lucia's got permission for a bandstand in the plaza. For Tariq, the market, the street dinners. City hall wants a builder.
    - I could build it. One last job. One last ladder. But I can't do the roof. Not with this knee. I'd need somebody who knows roofs.
    - Gus knows roofs. Gus is the best roofer I ever met.
    - Or I finish what's in the shed, quiet, on my own, and leave the bandstand to the young ones. Well? Don't just stand there.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Build it with Gus
      replyA:
      - Hm. Fine. FINE. I'll go round there. I'll knock. If he slams the door, it's your fault.
      - ...If he doesn't slam the door, it's also your fault. Somehow.
      flagsA:
      - bandstand_planned
      optionB: Finish it alone
      replyB:
      - Alone, then. Like always. It's what I'm good at.
      - Come round on Sunday. You can see what's in the shed. You've earned that much.
      flagsB:
      - walt_shed_project
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Two old idiots on a roof
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Three weeks. Three weeks of that man telling me my joints were wrong while I told him his tiles were crooked.
    - Kenji sat on a bench the whole time and said nothing, which is the most annoying thing anyone has ever done to me.
    - It's finished. Best thing on the street. Gus did the roof. I did everything else. Mostly. Don't tell him I said 'mostly'.
    happy: 1
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
